-- ============================================================================
-- D3 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Electrofacies, intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam), generated as the Associate tier's are.
--
-- What this tier owns: JUDGING GROUPS AGAINST CORE. The elbow, its drops and
-- drop fractions, an inertia that rises; the silhouette, its mean and each
-- cluster's, a row alone in its cluster; agglomerative Ward, complete and
-- average linkage, the linkage matrix, the cut and a re-cut; the contingency
-- table, one-to-one and majority matching of clusters to core facies; the
-- adjusted Rand index. Digest sections 14 to 20.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. No figure chooses k alone: the elbow picks
-- nothing, the silhouette can prefer another k than the core, majority
-- matching rewards splitting a facies, and agreement is counted in pairs so
-- renamed clusters score the same. The Professional capstone grades six
-- Professional quantities and grades no neighbour rule and no tree.
-- ============================================================================

